# Default-deny: nothing enters the build context unless it is named here.
#
# An allowlist rather than a list of exclusions, so that a new private file
# or directory alongside this repository is never uploaded by accident. It
# is also why no private path needs naming in this public file.
*

# The application
!server.py
!config.py
!security.py
!content.py
!blog.py
!search.py

# Dependencies, templates, static assets, and the articles
!requirements.txt
!templates/
!public/
!content/
